        <div class="vtm-grail"><i id="vtm-risk-i" style="left:50%"></i></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:11px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Every value is point-in-time — no look-ahead. Drag the playhead (or press play) and the cycle phase, stage, ladder state, regime, risk index, valuation, stance and the model\'s allocation all rewind to exactly what the dashboard showed that day. The ladder & regime are backtested by replaying the cycle engine on each day\'s history.','每个数值均为实时快照 — 无前视。拖动播放头（或点击播放），周期阶段、阶梯状态、格局、风险指数、估值、立场与模型仓位都会回溯到当天看板的真实状态。阶梯与格局通过对每日历史重放周期引擎回测得到。') }}</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== MULTI-TIMEFRAME TECHNICALS ===================== -->
  {% if mtf_rows %}
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Multi-Timeframe Momentum & Technicals · Daily → Monthly', '多周期动量与技术指标 · 日线 → 月线') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Cycle ladder (shared with the stock analyzer)', '周期阶梯（与个股分析器一致）') }}
        {% if ladder.regime %}<b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if ladder.regime=='bear' else ('var(--blue)' if ladder.regime=='bull' else 'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ td(ladder.regime_label or ladder.regime) }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      {% if ladder.label %}<div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Daily cycle state','日线周期状态') }}</span><span><b>{{ t(ladder.label, ladder.label_zh) }}</b>{% if ladder.age_short %} <span class="faint">· {{ td(ladder.age_short) }}</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if ladder.summary_line %}<div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t(ladder.summary_line, ladder.summary_line_zh) }}</div>{% endif %}
      {% if ladder.entry_text %}<div class="sub" style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--ink)">{{ t(ladder.entry_text, ladder.entry_text_zh) }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Same calibrated DCL/ICL cycle engine the Macro Dashboard runs on every asset (crypto preset: ~56–70d daily cycle).', '与宏观看板对每个资产运行的、同一套已校准的 DCL/ICL 周期引擎（加密预设：约 56–70 天日线周期）。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Technicals across timeframes', '跨周期技术指标') }}</h3>
      {% set tfc = {'up':'var(--blue)','down':'var(--r3)','flat':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set mz = {'up':'转多','down':'转空','pos':'多头','neg':'空头'} %}
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px">
        <tr style="color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em">
          <td style="padding:5px 4px">{{ t('TF','周期') }}</td><td style="text-align:right">RSI</td><td style="text-align:right">StochRSI</td><td style="text-align:right">MACD</td><td style="text-align:right">{{ t('Trend','趋势') }}</td></tr>
        {% set tlab = {'D':['Daily','日线'],'3D':['3-Day','3日'],'W':['Weekly','周线'],'2W':['Biweekly','双周'],'ME':['Monthly','月线']} %}
        {% for r in mtf_rows %}
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--grid)">
          <td style="padding:7px 4px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)">{{ t(tlab.get(r.key,[r.key,r.key])[0], tlab.get(r.key,[r.key,r.key])[1]) }}</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if r.rsi14 and r.rsi14>=70 else ('var(--blue)' if r.rsi14 and r.rsi14<=30 else 'var(--text)') }}">{{ r.rsi14 if r.rsi14 is not none else '—' }}</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if r.stoch and r.stoch>=80 else ('var(--blue)' if r.stoch and r.stoch<=20 else 'var(--text)') }}">{{ r.stoch if r.stoch is not none else '—' }}</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if r.macd in ('up','pos') else 'var(--r3)' }}">{{ t(r.macd|capitalize, mz.get(r.macd, r.macd)) }}</td>
          <td style="text-align:right"><i style="display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ tfc.get(r.trend,'var(--muted)') }}"></i></td>
        </tr>{% endfor %}
      </table>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('RSI red >70 / blue <30; StochRSI red >80 / blue <20. The trend dot is each timeframe’s MACD-trend direction — when short timeframes turn up while long ones stay red, it is an unconfirmed turn (a counter-trend bounce).', 'RSI 红 >70 / 蓝 <30；StochRSI 红 >80 / 蓝 <20。趋势圆点为各周期 MACD 趋势方向 — 当短周期转多而长周期仍为红时，即为未确认转向（逆势反弹）。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>{% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== MOMENTUM / STRUCTURE ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Momentum & Structure', '动量与结构') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card"><h3>{{ t('Momentum', '动量') }} <span class="faint" style="font-size:14px">{{ momentum }}</span></h3>{{ charts.momentum|safe }}
      <div class="sub">{{ t('Bullish above +0.5, bearish below −0.5. State:', '高于 +0.5 看多，低于 −0.5 看空。状态：') }} <b>{{ td(momentum_state) }}</b>.</div></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>{{ t('Structure Shift', '结构转变') }} <span class="faint" style="font-size:14px">{{ structure }}</span></h3>{{ charts.structure|safe }}
      <div class="sub">{{ t('Constructive above +0.5, broken below −0.5. State:', '高于 +0.5 偏多，低于 −0.5 走坏。状态：') }} <b>{{ td(structure_state) }}</b>.</div></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== IMPULSE ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Impulse · acceleration of the move (start & exhaustion)', '脉冲 · 走势加速度（启动与衰竭）') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Impulse', '脉冲') }}
        {% set ic = {'positive':'var(--blue)','negative':'var(--r3)','neutral':'var(--muted)'} %}
        {% set iz = {'positive':'正向','negative':'负向','neutral':'中性'} %}
        <b style="color:{{ ic.get(impulse.state,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t((impulse.state or '—')|upper, iz.get(impulse.state,'—')) }}</b>
        <span class="faint" style="font-size:14px"> {{ impulse.value if impulse.value is not none else '—' }}</span></h3>
      {% if impulse.pos_pct is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Positive participation (14d)','正向占比（14 天）') }}</span><span><b>{{ impulse.pos_pct }}%</b></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ impulse.pos_pct }}%"></div></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Trend efficiency (chop gate)','趋势效率（震荡过滤）') }}</span><span><b>{{ impulse.er if impulse.er is not none else '—' }}</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('(0 = chop, 1 = clean trend)','（0 = 震荡，1 = 单边）') }}</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Glassnode/Swissblock-style: the z-scored ACCELERATION of momentum (MACD-histogram), gated by trend-efficiency so chop reads ~0, fused with a funding/OI positioning shock. It catches the START of a move and exhaustion — a level says “cheap”, Impulse says “selling force is burning out now.”', 'Glassnode/Swissblock 风格：动量的标准化加速度（MACD 柱），用趋势效率过滤震荡（震荡时约为 0），并融合资金费率/持仓的持仓冲击。它捕捉走势的启动与衰竭 — 估值说“便宜”，脉冲说“抛压此刻正在衰竭”。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Why it matters', '为何重要') }}</h3>
      <div class="sub">{{ t('CALIBRATED & CONFIRMED in both split-halves (2014→) — one of only four signals to clear that bar (with the Risk Index, BFI and the macro overlay). Strong-positive impulse (>0.5) preceded +3.7%/7d and +32.6%/90d at 66% hit; the deeply-negative “exhaustion” band (<−0.5) bounced +1.5%/7d (selling force spent). It feeds the short-term scenario odds.', '在两个分半样本中均已校准且确认（2014 起）— 仅有的四个达标信号之一（另三为风险指数、BFI 与宏观叠加）。强正脉冲（>0.5）后 7 天 +3.7%、90 天 +32.6%、胜率 66%；深度负值“衰竭”区（<−0.5）后 7 天反弹 +1.5%（抛压耗尽）。它参与短期情景概率。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== BFI ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Bitcoin Fundamental Index', '比特币基本面指数（BFI）') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card"><h3>{{ t('BFI = Network Growth × Liquidity', 'BFI = 网络增长 × 流动性') }}</h3>{{ charts.bfi|safe }}
      <div class="sub">{{ t('Positive above 60, negative below 40. Now:', '高于 60 为正向，低于 40 为负向。当前：') }} <b>{{ bfi }}</b> ({{ td(bfi_zone) }}).</div></div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Fundamental gauges', '基本面指标') }}</h3>
      {% set gauge_zh = {'Network Growth':'网络增长','Liquidity':'流动性','BFI':'BFI'} %}
      {% for nm,val in [('Network Growth',network_growth),('Liquidity',liquidity),('BFI',bfi)] %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t(nm, gauge_zh[nm]) }}</span><span><b>{{ val if val is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ val if val is not none else 0 }}%"></div></div></div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:14px">{{ t('Network Growth = active-address momentum percentile. Liquidity = realized-cap + stablecoin + ETF-flow composite. BFI never turned negative through the Feb–Mar 2025 stress in Swissblock\'s framing — a long-term anchor.', '网络增长 = 活跃地址动量百分位。流动性 = 已实现市值 + 稳定币 + ETF 资金流的综合。在 Swissblock 的框架下，BFI 在 2025 年 2 月至 3 月的压力期间从未转负 — 一个长期锚点。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== VALUATION & CYCLE ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Valuation & Cycle · where in the cycle', '估值与周期 · 处于周期何处') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Valuation anchors', '估值锚点') }}
        {% if valuation.deep_value %}<b style="color:var(--blue)"> · {{ t('DEEP VALUE','深度低估') }}</b>
        {% elif valuation.overvalued %}<b style="color:var(--r3)"> · {{ t('OVERVALUED','高估') }}</b>
        {% elif valuation.state %}<span class="faint"> · {{ td(valuation.state|capitalize) }}</span>{% endif %}</h3>
      {% for nm,v,p in [('MVRV-Z', valuation.mvrv_z, valuation.mvrv_z_pctile), ('NUPL', valuation.nupl, None), ('Mayer Multiple', valuation.mayer, None)] %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t(nm) }}</span><span><b>{{ v if v is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if p is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ p }}%ile)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      {% endfor %}
      {% if valuation.reserve_risk is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Reserve Risk','储备风险') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if valuation.rr_top else ('var(--blue)' if (valuation.reserve_risk_pctile is not none and valuation.reserve_risk_pctile < 25) else 'var(--ink)') }}">{{ '%.4f'|format(valuation.reserve_risk) }}</b>{% if valuation.reserve_risk_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ valuation.reserve_risk_pctile }}%ile)</span>{% endif %}{% if valuation.rr_top %} <b style="color:var(--r3)"> · {{ t('TOP','顶部') }}</b>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Calibrated (2010→): MVRV-Z below 0 preceded +40%/90d at 72% hit — the deepest-history accumulation signal; Mayer above 2.4 marked tops (−14%/90d). Both are now folded into the allocation: buy deep value, trim cycle tops.', '已校准（2010 起）：MVRV-Z 低于 0 时未来 90 天平均 +40%、胜率 72% — 历史最久的累积信号；Mayer 高于 2.4 标记顶部（90 天 −14%）。两者已并入仓位：低估买入、顶部减仓。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:6px">{{ t('Reserve Risk = price vs the opportunity cost of HODLing (checkonchain, 2010→): above 0.02 is a powerful TOP — −42.6%/90d at just 4% hit; the low band is accumulation (+18.6%/90d).', '储备风险 = 价格 vs 持有的机会成本（checkonchain，2010 起）：高于 0.02 是强力顶部信号 — 90 天 −42.6%、胜率仅 4%；低位区为累积（90 天 +18.6%）。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Miner cycle & cost basis', '矿工周期与成本基准') }}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Hash Ribbons','哈希丝带') }}</span><span><b>{{ td(valuation.hash_ribbon|capitalize) if valuation.hash_ribbon else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Puell Multiple','Puell 倍数') }}</span><span><b>{{ valuation.puell if valuation.puell is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      {% if valuation.sth_cb_ratio is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Price vs STH cost basis','价格 vs 短期持有者成本') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if valuation.sth_cb_ratio>=0 else 'var(--r3)' }}">{{ '%+0.1f'|format(valuation.sth_cb_ratio) }}%</b></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Hash Ribbons = 30/60-day hashrate (miner capitulation marks bottoms in hindsight, no average-return edge — context). STH cost basis is the bull/bear pivot.', '哈希丝带 = 30/60 天算力（矿工投降事后标记底部，但无平均收益优势 — 仅作背景）。短期持有者成本是牛熊分界。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== OPTIONS STRUCTURE ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Options Structure · Deribit (forward-looking vol)', '期权结构 · Deribit（前瞻波动率）') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Implied volatility', '隐含波动率') }}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('DVOL (crypto VIX)','DVOL（加密 VIX）') }}</span><span><b>{{ options.dvol if options.dvol is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if options.dvol_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ options.dvol_pctile }}%ile)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Variance risk premium (IV−RV)','方差风险溢价（IV−RV）') }}</span><span><b>{{ options.vrp if options.vrp is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      {% if options.vrp_state %}
      {% set vs = {'vol_rich':['Vol rich (sell-vol bias)','波动偏贵（卖波倾向）','var(--r3)'],'vol_cheap':['Vol cheap (expansion risk)','波动偏便宜（扩张风险）','var(--amber)'],'vol_fair':['Vol fair','波动合理','var(--muted)']} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('VRP regime','VRP 状态') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ vs.get(options.vrp_state,['','','var(--muted)'])[2] }}">{{ t(vs.get(options.vrp_state,['—'])[0], vs.get(options.vrp_state,['—','—'])[1]) }}</b>{% if options.vrp_z is not none %} <span class="faint">(z {{ '%+0.1f'|format(options.vrp_z) }})</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if options.em_pct is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Implied 30d expected move (±1σ)','隐含 30 天预期波动（±1σ）') }}</span><span><b>±{{ options.em_pct }}%</b> <span class="faint">({{ options.em_lower|money }}–{{ options.em_upper|money }})</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('ATM IV 30d / term slope','平值 30 天 IV / 期限斜率') }}</span><span><b>{{ options.atm_iv_30d if options.atm_iv_30d is not none else '—' }}</b> / {{ options.term_slope if options.term_slope is not none else '—' }}</span></div></div>
      {% if options.rv_cone_pctile is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Realized-vol cone (full history)','已实现波动锥（全历史）') }}</span><span><b>{{ options.rv_realized }}%</b> <span class="faint">({{ options.rv_cone_pctile }}%ile · {{ t('vol-of-vol','波动的波动') }} {{ options.vov_pctile }}%ile)</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if options.gamma_regime %}
      {% set gr = {'long':['Long-gamma (pinning)','正Gamma（黏滞）','var(--blue)'],'short':['Short-gamma (amplifies)','负Gamma（放大）','var(--r3)']} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Dealer gamma regime / flip','做市商 Gamma 格局 / 翻转位') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ gr.get(options.gamma_regime,['','','var(--muted)'])[2] }}">{{ t(gr.get(options.gamma_regime,['—'])[0], gr.get(options.gamma_regime,['—','—'])[1]) }}</b> <span class="faint">({{ t('flip','翻转') }} {{ options.gamma_flip|money if options.gamma_flip else '—' }} · {{ '%+0.1f'|format(options.dist_to_flip_pct) if options.dist_to_flip_pct is not none else '—' }}%)</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Calibrated (2021→, confirmation-only): DVOL 70–90 is the bleed zone (−13%/90d); VRP below −5 (realized overshooting implied) marked recoveries (+17%/90d).', '已校准（2021 起，仅作确认）：DVOL 70–90 为失血区（90 天 −13%）；VRP 低于 −5（已实现超过隐含）标记反弹（90 天 +17%）。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px">{{ t('The realized-vol cone + vol-of-vol are full-history (2015→) — the only vol-regime read that survives BOTH calibration halves. U-shaped at 90d: a high vol-of-vol percentile (panic) preceded +37.7%/90d at 76% hit (capitulation bounce), a calm cone +24.8%/90d. A near-term risk gauge, not a direction call.','已实现波动锥与“波动的波动”为全历史（2015 起）— 唯一在两个校准半样本中均成立的波动状态读数。90 天呈 U 形：高“波动的波动”分位（恐慌）后 90 天 +37.7%、胜率 76%（投降式反弹），平静波动锥 90 天 +24.8%。为近端风险计，而非方向判断。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Dealer gamma-flip = the spot where net dealer gamma crosses zero. ABOVE it (long-gamma) dealers hedge AGAINST the move → pinning / mean-reversion / suppressed vol; BELOW it (short-gamma) they hedge WITH the move → amplification / trend / vol expansion. A regime BOUNDARY, not a forecast — snapshot-only (no free options history) so it accrues forward rather than being back-calibrated.','做市商 Gamma 翻转位 = 净 Gamma 过零的现货价位。在其上方（正 Gamma），做市商逆势对冲 → 黏滞 / 均值回归 / 波动受抑；在其下方（负 Gamma），顺势对冲 → 放大 / 趋势 / 波动扩张。这是格局边界而非预测 — 仅快照（期权无免费历史），故向前累积而非回溯校准。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Skew & positioning (snapshot)', '偏斜与持仓（快照）') }}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('25Δ risk reversal','25Δ 风险逆转') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if (options.rr_25d is not none and options.rr_25d<0) else 'var(--blue)' }}">{{ options.rr_25d if options.rr_25d is not none else '—' }}</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('(<0 = downside bid)','（<0 = 下行需求）') }}</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Put/Call OI ratio','看跌/看涨 持仓比') }}</span><span><b>{{ options.put_call if options.put_call is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Max pain','最大痛点') }}</span><span><b>{{ ('$%s'|format('{:,.0f}'.format(options.max_pain))) if options.max_pain is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      {% if options.basis_ann is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Futures basis (annualized)','期货基差（年化）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if options.basis_ann>15 else ('var(--blue)' if options.basis_ann>=0 else 'var(--r3)') }}">{{ '%+0.1f'|format(options.basis_ann) }}%</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('(>15 froth, <0 stress)','（>15 过热，<0 承压）') }}</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if options.skew_term is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Skew term (7d−90d)','偏斜期限（7天−90天）') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%+0.3f'|format(options.skew_term) }}</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('(>0 = acute near-term fear)','（>0 = 近端急性恐慌）') }}</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if options.iv_term_state %}
      {% set its = {'contango':['Contango (calm)','正向（平静）','var(--blue)'],'backwardation':['Backwardation (front-end stress)','逆向（近端承压）','var(--r3)'],'flat':['Flat','持平','var(--muted)']} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('IV term structure','IV 期限结构') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ its.get(options.iv_term_state,['','','var(--muted)'])[2] }}">{{ t(its.get(options.iv_term_state,['—'])[0], its.get(options.iv_term_state,['—','—'])[1]) }}</b>{% if options.iv_term_spread is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ '%+0.1f'|format(options.iv_term_spread) }}pt 90d−30d)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Rebuilt from the free Deribit chain (what Laevitas sells) — now incl. the futures-basis curve (leverage demand) and the skew term structure (near-term vs structural fear). The per-strike snapshot accumulates daily — context until ~6–12mo of history enables calibration.', '基于免费的 Deribit 期权链重建（即 Laevitas 所售）— 现含期货基差曲线（杠杆需求）与偏斜期限结构（近端 vs 结构性恐慌）。逐行权价快照每日累积 — 在约 6–12 个月历史前仅作背景。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== LEVERAGE & POSITIONING ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Leverage & Positioning · liquidation risk', '杠杆与持仓 · 清算风险') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Leverage state', '杠杆状态') }}</h3>
      {% if leverage.stress is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Leverage stress','杠杆压力') }}</span><span><b>{{ leverage.stress }}/100</b></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ leverage.stress }}%"></div></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Aggregate open interest','总持仓量') }}</span><span><b>{{ ('$%.1fB'|format(leverage.oi_total/1e9)) if leverage.oi_total is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if leverage.oi_mcap_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ leverage.oi_mcap_pctile }}%ile vs mcap)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Funding (annualized)','资金费率（年化）') }}</span><span><b>{{ ('%+0.1f%%'|format(leverage.funding_annual)) if leverage.funding_annual is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if leverage.funding_z is not none %} <span class="faint">(z {{ leverage.funding_z }})</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      {% if leverage.okx_ls_ratio is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('OKX retail long/short (accounts)','OKX 散户多空比（账户数）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if leverage.okx_ls_lean=='crowded_long' else ('var(--blue)' if leverage.okx_ls_lean=='crowded_short' else 'var(--ink)') }}">{{ '%.2f'|format(leverage.okx_ls_ratio) }}</b>{% if leverage.okx_ls_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ leverage.okx_ls_pctile }}%ile{% if leverage.okx_ls_z is not none %} · z {{ leverage.okx_ls_z }}{% endif %})</span>{% endif %}
      {% if leverage.okx_ls_lean=='crowded_long' %} <span class="faint" style="color:var(--r3)">· {{ t('crowded longs (contrarian caution, not a buy)','多头拥挤（反向警示，非买入信号）') }}</span>{% elif leverage.okx_ls_lean=='crowded_short' %} <span class="faint" style="color:var(--blue)">· {{ t('crowded shorts (capitulation context)','空头拥挤（投降式背景）') }}</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if leverage.okx_taker_buy is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('OKX taker buy/sell flow','OKX 主动买卖盘占比') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%.0f'|format(100*leverage.okx_taker_buy) }}%</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('buy share','主动买占比') }}{% if leverage.okx_taker_pctile is not none %} ({{ leverage.okx_taker_pctile }}%ile){% endif %}</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if leverage.cme_basis is not none %}
      {% set creg = {'contango':'var(--amber)','backwardation':'var(--r3)','flat':'var(--muted)'} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('CME basis (regulated carry)','CME 基差（受监管套利）') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%+0.2f'|format(leverage.cme_basis) }}%</b> <span class="faint">(~{{ '%+0.0f'|format(leverage.cme_basis_ann) }}%/yr · {{ leverage.cme_basis_pctile }}%ile · <span style="color:{{ creg.get(leverage.cme_basis_regime,'var(--muted)') }}">{{ td(leverage.cme_basis_regime) }}</span>)</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if leverage.oi_divergence is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('OI vs price divergence (14d)','持仓 vs 价格背离（14 天）') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%+0.1f'|format(leverage.oi_divergence) }}%</b></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if leverage.carry_state %}
      {% set fcs = {'froth':['Froth (longs paying up)','过热（多头付溢价）','var(--r3)'],'stress':['Stress (deleveraging)','承压（去杠杆）','var(--blue)'],'neutral':['Neutral','中性','var(--muted)']} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Consolidated futures carry','综合期货套利') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ fcs.get(leverage.carry_state,['','','var(--muted)'])[2] }}">{{ t(fcs.get(leverage.carry_state,['—'])[0], fcs.get(leverage.carry_state,['—','—'])[1]) }}</b>{% if leverage.carry_z is not none %} <span class="faint">(z {{ '%+0.1f'|format(leverage.carry_z) }})</span>{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:4px;font-size:11px">{{ t('CME + perp funding + Deribit basis, each z-scored vs 1y then weight-blended into one leverage-cycle read. Context (~0 forward edge measured), like CME basis alone.','CME + 永续资金费率 + Deribit 基差，各自对 1 年 z 标准化后加权为单一杠杆周期读数。背景（实测前瞻优势约为零），与单独 CME 基差一致。') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Rebuilt from 15-exchange BGeometrics OI + funding (what CoinGlass aggregates). Calibrated (2022→, confirmation): funding-z below −1 (crowded shorts) preceded +18%/90d at 70% hit; OI building faster than price drags forward returns.', '基于 15 家交易所 BGeometrics 持仓 + 资金费率重建（即 CoinGlass 所聚合）。已校准（2022 起，确认）：资金费率 z 低于 −1（空头拥挤）未来 90 天 +18%、胜率 70%；持仓增速快于价格则拖累未来收益。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('How to read it', '如何解读') }}</h3>
      <div class="sub">{{ t('This layer is a short-horizon RISK amplifier, not a trend signal. High leverage stress + crowded one-sided funding = fragility: a small move can cascade into liquidations. Deeply negative funding or a sharp OI flush (deleveraging) is the contrarian tell that a local bottom is near.', '该层是短期风险放大器，而非趋势信号。高杠杆压力 + 单边拥挤资金费率 = 脆弱：小幅波动可能引发连环清算。深度负资金费率或持仓骤降（去杠杆）是局部底部临近的反向信号。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px">{{ t('CME basis is the REGULATED, real-money carry (front-month future vs spot) — distinct from the offshore perp funding above. Rich contango = leverage/positioning froth; backwardation = stress. HONEST: measured ~ZERO forward-return edge for BTC (rank-IC ~0, 2021→), so it is shown as institutional POSITIONING CONTEXT, not a predictive signal.', 'CME 基差为受监管的真实资金套利（近月期货对现货）— 区别于上方离岸永续资金费率。高升水 = 杠杆/持仓过热；贴水 = 承压。诚实说明：对 BTC 前瞻收益的实测优势约为零（秩 IC ≈ 0，2021 起），故仅作机构持仓背景，而非预测信号。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px">{{ t('OKX retail long/short & taker flow are DISPLAY-ONLY positioning context (rubik free data, shallow history) — shown as crowding context, never wired into the allocation or scored. Extreme retail-long = crowded/contrarian, not a buy.', 'OKX 散户多空比与主动买卖盘为仅展示的持仓背景（rubik 免费数据，历史较浅）— 仅作拥挤度背景，不参与仓位或评分。散户极度看多 = 拥挤/反向，而非买入信号。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== MACRO LIQUIDITY & RISK APPETITE ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Macro Liquidity & Risk Appetite · strategic backdrop', '宏观流动性与风险偏好 · 战略背景') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      {% set mr = macro.regime %}
      {% set mr_color = {'tailwind':'var(--blue)','headwind':'var(--r3)','neutral':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set mr_label = {'tailwind':'TAILWIND','headwind':'HEADWIND','neutral':'NEUTRAL'} %}
      {% set mr_zh = {'tailwind':'顺风','headwind':'逆风','neutral':'中性'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Macro backdrop', '宏观背景') }}
        <b style="color:{{ mr_color.get(mr,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(mr_label.get(mr,'—'), mr_zh.get(mr,'—')) }}</b>
        {% if macro.score is not none %}<span class="faint" style="font-size:13px"> ({{ '%+0.2f'|format(macro.score) }})</span>{% endif %}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Net liquidity (WALCL−RRP−TGA)','净流动性（WALCL−RRP−TGA）') }}</span><span><b>{{ ('$%.2fT'|format(macro.net_liq_bn/1000)) if macro.net_liq_bn is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if macro.net_liq_roc is not none %} <span class="faint" style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if macro.net_liq_roc>=0 else 'var(--r3)' }}">({{ '%+0.1f'|format(macro.net_liq_roc) }}% 13w)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      {% if macro.global_m2_yoy is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Global M2 growth (US+China)','全球 M2 增速（美+中）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if macro.global_m2_yoy>=5 else 'var(--r3)' }}">{{ macro.global_m2_yoy }}% YoY</b> <span class="faint">({{ td((macro.global_liq_regime or '')|capitalize) }})</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if macro.get('stbl_growth_z') is not none %}
      {% set sreg = {'expanding':'var(--blue)','contracting':'var(--r3)','neutral':'var(--muted)'} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Stablecoin tide (crypto-native liquidity)','稳定币潮汐（加密原生流动性）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ sreg.get(macro.stbl_regime,'var(--muted)') }}">{{ td((macro.stbl_regime or '')|capitalize) }}</b> <span class="faint">(z {{ '%+0.1f'|format(macro.stbl_growth_z) }} · ${{ macro.stbl_mcap_bn }}B)</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if macro.peg_state %}
      {% set pst = {'stable':['Stable','稳定','var(--blue)'],'watch':['Watch','观察','var(--amber)'],'break':['BREAK','脱锚','var(--red)']} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Stablecoin peg health (USDT/USDC/DAI)','稳定币锚定健康（USDT/USDC/DAI）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ pst.get(macro.peg_state,['','','var(--muted)'])[2] }}">{{ t(pst.get(macro.peg_state,['—'])[0], pst.get(macro.peg_state,['—','—'])[1]) }}</b> <span class="faint">({{ t('max dev','最大偏离') }} {{ macro.peg_dev_bps }}bps)</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('10y real yield','10 年期实际收益率') }}</span><span><b>{{ ('%.2f%%'|format(macro.real_yield)) if macro.real_yield is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('HY credit spread (OAS)','高收益信用利差') }}</span><span><b>{{ ('%.2f%%'|format(macro.hy_oas)) if macro.hy_oas is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('VIX / Dollar (DXY)','VIX / 美元指数') }}</span><span><b>{{ macro.vix if macro.vix is not none else '—' }}</b> / {{ macro.dxy if macro.dxy is not none else '—' }}</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('Why it matters', '为何重要') }}</h3>
      <div class="sub">{{ t('CONFIRMED signal (robust in both calibration halves, 2014→ — one of only three, with the Risk Index and BFI). BTC tracks the RATE OF CHANGE of net liquidity, not its level. Measured 90-day forward returns by macro score:', '已确认信号（在两个校准半样本中均稳健，2014 起 — 仅有的三个之一，另两个是风险指数与 BFI）。BTC 跟随净流动性的变化率，而非其水平。按宏观评分的 90 天前瞻收益：') }}</div>
      <div class="mini" style="margin-top:8px"><div class="lab"><span style="color:var(--r3)">{{ t('Headwind (score < −0.3)','逆风（评分 < −0.3）') }}</span><span><b>+1.4%</b> <span class="faint">/90d · 41% hit</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span style="color:var(--blue)">{{ t('Tailwind (score > +0.3)','顺风（评分 > +0.3）') }}</span><span><b>+48.8%</b> <span class="faint">/90d · 76% hit</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('It is a STRATEGIC (months-horizon) context gauge — kept separate from the tactical allocation, which it did not improve when tested as an overlay. Read it as the tide BTC swims in.', '这是战略层（数月维度）的背景指标 — 与战术仓位分开，因为作为叠加测试时并未改善回测。可将其理解为 BTC 所处的潮汐。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Stablecoin tide = the GROWTH of total stablecoin supply (the pace new capital mints INTO crypto) — orthogonal to the fiat net-liquidity above. DIRECTIONAL (2018→, both-halves): an expanding tide (z 1–2) preceded +23%/90d at 76% hit; a contracting tide (z < −1, where we are now) preceded only +0.8%/90d at 42% hit — a measured headwind.','稳定币潮汐 = 稳定币总供给的增速（新资本铸入加密的速度）— 与上方法币净流动性正交。方向性（2018 起，两半样本）：扩张潮汐（z 1–2）后 90 天 +23%、胜率 76%；收缩潮汐（z < −1，即当前）后 90 天仅 +0.8%、胜率 42% — 一项实测逆风。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Peg health is a separate COLLATERAL-SOLVENCY monitor (max deviation across USDT/USDC/DAI). HONEST caveat: the one major break (USDC at SVB, Mar-2023, ~390bps) was followed by a BTC RALLY (banking-crisis hedge), so a peg break is situational AWARENESS — not a confirmed BTC risk-off signal. Shown as context, not a directional input.','锚定健康是另一项抵押品偿付能力监测（USDT/USDC/DAI 的最大偏离）。诚实提示：唯一一次重大脱锚（USDC 于 SVB，2023 年 3 月，约 390bps）之后 BTC 反而上涨（作为银行危机对冲），故脱锚为情境感知 — 并非已确认的 BTC 避险信号。仅作背景，不作方向输入。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== CRYPTO BREADTH ===================== -->
  {% if breadth and breadth.bucket and breadth.bucket != '—' %}
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Crypto Breadth · risk appetite across the curve', '加密广度 · 风险曲线上的偏好') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      {% set bkt = breadth.bucket %}
      {% set bk_color = {'Alt season':'var(--blue)','BTC season':'var(--amber)','Mixed':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set bk_zh = {'Alt season':'山寨季','BTC season':'BTC 季','Mixed':'混合'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Breadth regime', '广度状态') }}
        <b style="color:{{ bk_color.get(bkt,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(bkt, bk_zh.get(bkt, bkt)) }}</b>
        {% if breadth.score is not none %}<span class="faint" style="font-size:13px"> ({{ breadth.score|int }}/100)</span>{% endif %}</h3>
      {% if breadth.score is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Alt-season score (ETH/BTC + dominance)','山寨季评分（ETH/BTC + 占比）') }}</span><span><b>{{ breadth.score|int }}/100</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('0 = BTC-only · 100 = broad','0 = 仅 BTC · 100 = 广泛') }}</span></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ breadth.score|int }}%"></div></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if breadth.ethbtc is not none %}
      {% set es_color = {'alt':'var(--blue)','btc':'var(--amber)','mixed':'var(--muted)'} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('ETH/BTC (alt-cycle core)','ETH/BTC（山寨周期核心）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ es_color.get(breadth.ethbtc_season,'var(--ink)') }}">{{ '%.4f'|format(breadth.ethbtc) }}</b>{% if breadth.ethbtc_slope is not none %} <span class="faint" style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if breadth.ethbtc_slope>=0 else 'var(--r3)' }}">({{ '%+0.1f'|format(breadth.ethbtc_slope) }}% 8w)</span>{% endif %}{% if breadth.ethbtc_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">· {{ breadth.ethbtc_pctile|int }}%ile</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if breadth.soleth is not none %}
      {% set st_color = {'rising':'var(--blue)','falling':'var(--r3)','flat':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set st_lab = {'rising':['rising — high-beta bid','上升 — 高贝塔买盘'],'falling':['falling — risk-off','下降 — 避险'],'flat':['flat','走平']} %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('SOL/ETH (high-beta appetite)','SOL/ETH（高贝塔偏好）') }} <span class="faint">{{ t('NEW','新增') }}</span></span><span><b>{{ '%.4f'|format(breadth.soleth) }}</b>{% if breadth.soleth_trend %} <span class="faint" style="color:{{ st_color.get(breadth.soleth_trend,'var(--muted)') }}">· {{ t(st_lab.get(breadth.soleth_trend,['—'])[0], st_lab.get(breadth.soleth_trend,['—','—'])[1]) }}</span>{% endif %}{% if breadth.soleth_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">· {{ breadth.soleth_pctile|int }}%ile</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if breadth.dom is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('BTC dominance','BTC 占比') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%.1f%%'|format(breadth.dom) }}</b>{% if breadth.ethdom is not none %} <span class="faint">· ETH {{ '%.1f%%'|format(breadth.ethdom) }}</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('What breadth tells you', '广度说明什么') }}</h3>
      <div class="sub">{{ t('Breadth = how far OUT THE RISK CURVE capital is willing to go. BTC-only leadership (high dominance, falling ETH/BTC & SOL/ETH) = risk NARROWING — the late/defensive crypto tape. Alts and high-beta (SOL/ETH) participating = risk BROADENING — the speculative, risk-on tape.', '广度 = 资金愿意在风险曲线上走多远。仅 BTC 领先（占比高、ETH/BTC 与 SOL/ETH 下行）= 风险收窄 — 防御性的后期行情。山寨与高贝塔（SOL/ETH）参与 = 风险扩张 — 投机性的风险偏好行情。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px">{{ t('DISPLAY-ONLY context, not a timing signal. The ETH/BTC alt-cycle has only ~1.5–2 clean cycles of history (low calibration confidence) and breadth is largely COINCIDENT with the tape — it confirms the regime you are in, it does not lead it. The alt-season score is a labelled judgment blend, not an optimized factor.', '仅作背景展示，并非择时信号。ETH/BTC 山寨周期仅有约 1.5–2 个完整周期（校准置信度低），且广度与行情基本同步 — 它确认你所处的状态，而非领先它。山寨季评分为带标注的判断式混合，并非优化因子。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('SOL/ETH is the high-beta-appetite proxy: SOL leads ETH up in risk-on rotations and bleeds first when speculation fades. Read it alongside ETH/BTC, not alone.', 'SOL/ETH 为高贝塔偏好代理：风险偏好轮动时 SOL 领先 ETH 上涨，投机退潮时最先回落。应与 ETH/BTC 结合解读，而非单独使用。') }}</div>
