      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Smart-money divergence','聪明钱背离') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if onchain.premium_div=='distribution' else 'var(--blue)' }}">{{ t('US selling strength','美国逢高卖出') if onchain.premium_div=='distribution' else t('US buying weakness','美国逢低买入') }}</b></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('US-institutional demand spread, now SELF-COMPUTED from our own Coinbase-USD vs OKX-USDT prices (fresh daily, 2018→) and spliced with the bgeo index. Two measured reads: the extremity z carries a forward-return edge in BOTH market halves (rank-IC +0.08/7d → +0.18/90d, demand confirmation — the strongest new model), while an extreme overheated premium (>~1.5% FOMO) is the CONTRARIAN top tail (−5.9%/90d at 36% hit). The divergence flags when price and US demand disagree.', '美国机构需求价差，现由我们自有的 Coinbase-USD 与 OKX-USDT 价格自算（每日更新，2018 起），并与 bgeo 指数拼接。两个实测读数：极端 z 在两个市场半段均具前瞻收益优势（秩相关 IC：7 天 +0.08 → 90 天 +0.18，需求确认 — 新增模型中最强），而极端过热溢价（>约 1.5% 追高）为反向顶部尾部（90 天 −5.9%、胜率 36%）。背离用于提示价格与美国需求出现分歧。') }}</div>
    </div>
