          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>{% endif %}
    <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Per-issuer detail from Farside Investors (US$m, since 2024-01-11) — fresher and per-fund vs the aggregate above, our own dedicated collector (no longer quota-limited). The ex-GBTC net strips Grayscale\'s one-way unlock outflows; concentration shows how few funds carry the bid (IBIT dominates). ETF-era only (~2.4y) → CONTEXT, not a both-halves anchor.','按发行人明细，来自 Farside Investors（百万美元，2024-01-11 起）— 较上方汇总更新且分基金，为我们自有的专用采集器（不再受配额限制）。剔除 GBTC 的净额去除了 Grayscale 的单向解锁流出；集中度显示买盘由多少只基金承载（IBIT 主导）。仅 ETF 时代（约 2.4 年）→ 背景，而非双半段锚点。') }}</div>
    {% endif %}
