      <h3>{{ t('Halving cycle clock', '减半周期时钟') }}
        <b style="color:{{ ph_color.get(ph,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t((ph or '—')|upper, ph_zh.get(ph,'—')) }}</b></h3>
      {% if cycle.pct is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Cycle progress (since halving)','周期进度（自减半起）') }}</span><span><b>{{ cycle.pct }}%</b> <span class="faint">({{ cycle.days }}d)</span></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ cycle.pct if cycle.pct<=100 else 100 }}%"></div></div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if cycle.vdd is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Spending behaviour · VDD Multiple','支出行为 · VDD 倍数') }}</span><span><b>{{ cycle.vdd }}</b> <span class="faint">({{ cycle.vdd_pctile }}%ile · {{ t('>2.9 distribution, <0.75 dormant','>2.9 派发，<0.75 沉睡') }})</span></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('The ~4-year time axis the model lacked. Calibrated (n=3 cycles, a soft PRIOR): the accumulation phase (post-halving) averaged +48%/90d at 81% hit; the markdown phase (mid-cycle) just +5%/90d at 43% hit. It tilts the scenario odds, never triggers.', '模型此前缺失的约 4 年时间轴。已校准（3 个周期，软先验）：累积期（减半后）90 天平均 +48%、胜率 81%；下跌期（周期中段）仅 +5%、胜率 43%。它用于微调情景概率，从不作为触发。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      {% set cp = cycle_phase %}
      {% set cpc = {'markup':'var(--blue)','markdown':'var(--r3)'} %}
      {% set cpz = {'markup':'上涨腿','markdown':'下跌腿'} %}
      {% set kz = {'top':'顶部','bottom':'底部'} %}
      {% set stz = {'on_track':'按节奏','overdue':'已超期','invalidated':'已失效'} %}
      {% set stc = {'on_track':'var(--blue)','overdue':'var(--amber)','invalidated':'var(--r3)'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Cycle Phase Clock · 1064 / 364-day structure', '周期相位时钟 · 1064 / 364 天结构') }}
        {% if cp.phase %}<b style="color:{{ cpc.get(cp.phase,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(cp.phase|upper, cpz.get(cp.phase,'—')) }}</b>{% endif %}
        {% if cp.status and cp.status != 'on_track' %}<b style="color:{{ stc.get(cp.status,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(cp.status|replace('_',' ')|upper, stz.get(cp.status,'')) }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      {% if cp.pct is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Phase progress','相位进度') }}</span><span><b>{{ cp.pct }}%</b> <span class="faint">({{ cp.days_in|int }} / {{ cp.len|int }}d)</span></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ cp.pct if cp.pct<=100 else 100 }}%;background:{{ cpc.get(cp.phase,'var(--blue)') }}"></div></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Projected next pivot','预计下一转折') }}{% if cp.next_kind %} <span class="faint">{{ t(cp.next_kind, kz.get(cp.next_kind,'')) }}</span>{% endif %}</span><span><b>{{ cp.next_pivot or '—' }}</b>{% if cp.days_left is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ cp.days_left|int }}d)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('The chart\'s “1064 days up / 364 days down” structure, anchored on the observed cycle lows/highs. Measured vs our own price history: up-legs 1067/1059/1050d, down-legs 364/378d — mean error ~7 days, but only n=3 cycles (in-sample). It refines the cycle prior by the same ≤5pp as the halving clock, never triggers.', '图中“上涨 1064 天 / 下跌 364 天”结构，锚定于已观测的周期低/高点。与本站价格历史实测：上涨腿 1067/1059/1050 天，下跌腿 364/378 天 — 平均误差约 7 天，但仅 3 个周期（样本内）。它以与减半时钟相同的 ≤5pp 幅度优化周期先验，从不触发。') }}</div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Timing only — NOT amplitude (2025 gained ~240% vs >1000% in prior cycles), and we do NOT endorse the $37.5K “bottom” target floating with this theory. The 4-year cycle may be mutating as ETFs/institutions decouple BTC from the halving.', '仅为时间 — 非幅度（2025 涨约 240%，此前周期 >1000%），且我们不认可随该理论流传的 3.75 万美元“底部”目标。随着 ETF/机构令 BTC 与减半脱钩，四年周期可能正在演变。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('CME positioning & correlation', 'CME 持仓与相关性') }}
        {% if positioning.crowded %}<b style="color:var(--r3)"> · {{ t('CROWDED LONG','多头拥挤') }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('CME spec net (z-score)','CME 投机净持仓（z）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if positioning.crowded else 'var(--ink)' }}">{{ positioning.cot_z if positioning.cot_z is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if positioning.cot_net_pct is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ positioning.cot_net_pct }}% of OI)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('BTC↔S&P 500 correlation (90d)','BTC↔标普 500 相关性（90 天）') }}</span><span><b>{{ correlation.spx if correlation.spx is not none else '—' }}</b> <span class="faint">{{ td((correlation.regime or '')|capitalize) }}</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('BTC↔Gold correlation (90d)','BTC↔黄金 相关性（90 天）') }}</span><span><b>{{ correlation.gold if correlation.gold is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('CME net-spec (regulated, weekly) is the only real-money positioning input — crowded long (z>1.5) preceded −5.8%/90d at 35% hit (contrarian). Correlation tells what BTC trades as: coupled to equities (>0.4) averaged +13%/90d vs +33% when decoupled.', 'CME 投机净持仓（受监管、周度）是唯一的真实资金持仓输入 — 多头拥挤（z>1.5）后 90 天 −5.8%、胜率 35%（反向）。相关性显示 BTC 的交易属性：与股票耦合（>0.4）90 天平均 +13%，脱钩时 +33%。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== MASTERMIND FACTORS (new) ===================== -->
  {% if newf %}
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Mastermind Factors · miner margins · downside beta · holder spread · attention · flow', '高阶因子 · 矿工利润 · 下行贝塔 · 持有者价差 · 关注度 · 主动盘') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <!-- Miner economics (deep 2010-> margin anchor) -->
    <div class="card">
      {% set ms = newf.miner.state %}
      {% set ms_c = {'capitulation':'var(--blue)','stress':'var(--amber)','healthy':'var(--muted)','euphoria':'var(--r3)'} %}
      {% set ms_z = {'capitulation':'投降（筑底）','stress':'承压','healthy':'健康','euphoria':'亢奋'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Miner economics · hashprice', '矿工经济 · 哈希价格') }}
        {% if ms %}<b style="color:{{ ms_c.get(ms,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(ms|upper, ms_z.get(ms,'—')) }}</b>{% endif %}
        <span class="verdict v-conf" style="font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle">{{ t('deep 2010→','深度 2010→') }}</span></h3>
      {% if newf.miner.hashprice_pctile is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Hashprice percentile (margin position)','哈希价格百分位（利润水位）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if newf.miner.hashprice_pctile<20 else ('var(--r3)' if newf.miner.hashprice_pctile>85 else 'var(--ink)') }}">{{ newf.miner.hashprice_pctile }}%ile</b> <span class="faint">(z {{ '%+0.1f'|format(newf.miner.hashprice_z) if newf.miner.hashprice_z is not none else '—' }})</span></span></div>
        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:{{ newf.miner.hashprice_pctile }}%"></div></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Miner stress','矿工压力') }}</span><span><b>{{ newf.miner.stress if newf.miner.stress is not none else '—' }}/100</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Hashrate / difficulty shock (14d)','算力 / 难度冲击（14天）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if (newf.miner.hashrate_shock is not none and newf.miner.hashrate_shock<-8) else 'var(--ink)' }}">{{ '%+0.1f'|format(newf.miner.hashrate_shock) if newf.miner.hashrate_shock is not none else '—' }}%</b>{% if newf.miner.difficulty_shock is not none %} <span class="faint">/ {{ '%+0.1f'|format(newf.miner.difficulty_shock) }}%</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Hashprice = USD revenue per unit hashrate = the miner PROFIT MARGIN (the cause Puell/MPI see downstream). Deep history (CoinMetrics issuance + hashrate, 2010→) makes this a real cycle-bottom anchor: a compressed percentile = squeezed margins = capitulation/bottoming, and a sharp hashrate flush is the timestamped forced-shutdown trigger.', '哈希价格 = 每单位算力的美元收入 = 矿工利润率（Puell/MPI 在下游观察到的根因）。深度历史（CoinMetrics 发行量 + 算力，2010→）使其成为真正的周期底部锚点：低百分位 = 利润被压缩 = 投降/筑底，算力骤降则是被迫关机的精确触发。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Conditional downside/upside beta -->
    <div class="card">
      {% set br = newf.cbeta.regime %}
      {% set br_c = {'drawdown_amplifier':'var(--r3)','diversifier':'var(--blue)','mixed':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set br_l = {'drawdown_amplifier':['DRAWDOWN AMPLIFIER','回撤放大器'],'diversifier':['DIVERSIFIER','分散器'],'mixed':['MIXED','混合']} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Conditional beta · NDX downside vs upside', '条件贝塔 · 纳指下行 vs 上行') }}
        {% if br %}<b style="color:{{ br_c.get(br,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(br_l.get(br,['—'])[0], br_l.get(br,['—','—'])[1]) }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Downside beta (on NDX down-days)','下行贝塔（纳指下跌日）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if (newf.cbeta.down_beta is not none and newf.cbeta.down_beta>0.8) else 'var(--ink)' }}">{{ newf.cbeta.down_beta if newf.cbeta.down_beta is not none else '—' }}</b>{% if newf.cbeta.down_beta_pctile is not none %} <span class="faint">({{ newf.cbeta.down_beta_pctile }}%ile)</span>{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Upside beta (on NDX up-days)','上行贝塔（纳指上涨日）') }}</span><span><b>{{ newf.cbeta.up_beta if newf.cbeta.up_beta is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Asymmetry (up − down)','不对称（上 − 下）') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if (newf.cbeta.asym is not none and newf.cbeta.asym>=0) else 'var(--r3)' }}">{{ '%+0.2f'|format(newf.cbeta.asym) if newf.cbeta.asym is not none else '—' }}</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('(<0 = couples harder down)','（<0 = 下跌时耦合更强）') }}</span></span></div></div>
      {% if newf.cbeta.down_beta_gold is not none %}
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Downside beta to gold','对黄金的下行贝塔') }}</span><span><b>{{ newf.cbeta.down_beta_gold }}</b></span></div></div>{% endif %}
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('BTC couples HARD to risk assets on the way DOWN and decouples on the way UP — a single Pearson hides this, and the DOWNSIDE beta is what predicts forward drawdown. A negative asymmetry + a high downside-beta percentile = a drawdown-amplifier regime (BTC will fall with the Nasdaq); a low downside beta = it is trading as a diversifier. Pure compute on Yahoo closes.', 'BTC 在下跌时与风险资产强耦合、上涨时脱钩 — 单一皮尔逊相关掩盖了这一点，而下行贝塔才能预测前瞻回撤。负不对称 + 高下行贝塔百分位 = 回撤放大格局（BTC 将随纳指下跌）；低下行贝塔 = 其作为分散器交易。基于雅虎收盘价纯计算。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid cols-3" style="margin-top:18px">
    <!-- Holder spread -->
    <div class="card">
      {% set hst = newf.holders.state %}
      {% set hst_c = {'accumulation':'var(--blue)','distribution':'var(--r3)','neutral':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set hst_z = {'accumulation':'累积','distribution':'派发','neutral':'中性'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Holder spread', '持有者价差') }}
        {% if hst %}<b style="color:{{ hst_c.get(hst,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(hst|capitalize, hst_z.get(hst,'—')) }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('STH−LTH SOPR spread','短−长持有者 SOPR 价差') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%+0.3f'|format(newf.holders.sopr_spread) if newf.holders.sopr_spread is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('STH realized-price premium','短持成本溢价') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%+0.1f'|format(newf.holders.realized_premium) if newf.holders.realized_premium is not none else '—' }}%</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Short- vs long-term holders realizing profit. STH cost basis far above the market = late-cycle distribution; below = early accumulation. bgeo cohorts are ~1 cycle → context, accruing toward calibration.', '短期 vs 长期持有者的获利了结。短持成本远高于全市场 = 周期后段派发；低于则为早期累积。bgeo 队列约一个周期 → 背景，正向积累中。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Attention -->
    <div class="card">
      {% set at = newf.attention.state %}
      {% set at_c = {'mania':'var(--r3)','apathy':'var(--blue)','normal':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set at_z = {'mania':'狂热','apathy':'冷清','normal':'正常'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Attention · Wikipedia', '关注度 · 维基百科') }}
        {% if at %}<b style="color:{{ at_c.get(at,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(at|capitalize, at_z.get(at,'—')) }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Pageviews (7d avg)','页面浏览（7天均）') }}</span><span><b>{{ '{:,}'.format(newf.attention.views|int) if newf.attention.views is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Attention z-score','关注度 z 值') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--r3)' if (newf.attention.z is not none and newf.attention.z>2) else ('var(--blue)' if (newf.attention.z is not none and newf.attention.z<-1) else 'var(--ink)') }}">{{ '%+0.1f'|format(newf.attention.z) if newf.attention.z is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('Wikipedia “Bitcoin” pageviews (keyless, 2015→) — the rare attention source that survives both halves. Attention predicts VOL not direction: a mania spike = froth/blow-off risk, apathy = disinterest bottoms. EXTREMES-only.', '维基百科“Bitcoin”页面浏览（无需密钥，2015→）— 罕见的能在前后两半段均成立的关注度来源。关注度预测波动而非方向：狂热飙升 = 过热风险，冷清 = 无人问津的底部。仅看极值。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Taker flow -->
    <div class="card">
      {% set tdv = newf.taker.divergence %}
      {% set tdv_c = {'bullish':'var(--blue)','bearish':'var(--r3)','aligned':'var(--muted)'} %}
      {% set tdv_z = {'bullish':'看多背离','bearish':'看空背离','aligned':'一致'} %}
      <h3>{{ t('Taker flow · CVD', '主动盘 · CVD') }}
        {% if tdv %}<b style="color:{{ tdv_c.get(tdv,'var(--muted)') }}"> · {{ t(tdv|capitalize, tdv_z.get(tdv,'—')) }}</b>{% endif %}</h3>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Taker buy share','主动买盘占比') }}</span><span><b style="color:{{ 'var(--blue)' if (newf.taker.buy_share is not none and newf.taker.buy_share>=0.5) else 'var(--r3)' }}">{{ '%.0f'|format(100*newf.taker.buy_share) if newf.taker.buy_share is not none else '—' }}%</b> <span class="faint">(z {{ '%+0.1f'|format(newf.taker.z) if newf.taker.z is not none else '—' }})</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('30d CVD (cumulative imbalance)','30天 CVD（累计失衡）') }}</span><span><b>{{ '%+0.2f'|format(newf.taker.cvd) if newf.taker.cvd is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">{{ t('OKX taker buy/(buy+sell): >50% = net aggressive buying. The price-vs-CVD divergence is a momentum-exhaustion tell. OKX rubik history is shallow (~6mo) → display/accrue-forward, never scored.', 'OKX 主动买/(买+卖)：>50% = 净主动买入。价格与 CVD 背离是动量衰竭信号。OKX rubik 历史较浅（约6个月）→ 仅展示/正向积累，不参与评分。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== CROSS-ASSET MAP ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('Cross-Asset Regime Map · Trend (3d) & Conviction', '跨资产周期图 · 趋势（3 天）与信心') }}</div>
  <div class="grid cols-3">
    {% for g in cross %}
    <div class="card">
      <div class="cat-h">{{ td(g.group) }}</div>
      <table class="catbl">
        {% for r in g.rows %}
        <tr>
          <td class="a">{{ r.label }}</td>
          <td class="r"><span class="chip {{ 'chip-bull' if r.trend=='Bull' else ('chip-bear' if r.trend=='Bear' else 'chip-ghost') }}" style="padding:3px 10px">{{ t(r.trend, tr(r.trend|lower)) }}</span></td>
          <td class="r"><span class="dots">
            {% for i in range(3) %}<i class="{{ 'on' if i<r.conv else '' }}{{ ' bear' if r.trend=='Bear' else '' }}"></i>{% endfor %}
          </span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== ALERT TIMELINE ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title" id="timeline">{{ t('Alert Timeline · last', '警报时间线 · 最近') }} {{ timeline_days }} {{ t('days', '天') }}
    <span class="faint" style="font-weight:600;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0"> · {{ n_alerts }} {{ t('alerts', '条警报') }}</span></div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="tl-filters">
      {% set filter_zh = {'All':'全部','Flash Crash':'闪崩','Risk':'风险','Structure':'结构','Momentum':'动量','Other':'其他'} %}
      {% for f,lab in [('all','All'),('flash','Flash Crash'),('risk','Risk'),('structure','Structure'),('momentum','Momentum'),('other','Other')] %}
      <button class="tlf {{ 'active' if f=='all' else '' }}" data-f="{{ f }}">{{ t(lab, filter_zh[lab]) }}</button>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if timeline %}
    <div class="timeline">
      {% for day in timeline %}
      <div class="tl-day">
        <div class="tl-date">{{ t(day.daylabel, day.daylabel_zh) }}</div>
        {% for e in day.events %}
        <details class="tl-item sev-{{ e.severity }}" data-f="{{ e.filter }}">
          <summary>
            <span class="tl-node n-{{ e.type }} n-{{ e.severity }}"></span>
            <span class="tl-chip f-{{ e.filter }}">{{ t(e.label, e.label_zh) }}</span>
            <span class="tl-head">{{ t(e.headline, e.headline_zh) }}</span>
            <span class="tl-time">{{ e.time }}</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="tl-detail">
            {{ t(e.detail, e.detail_zh) }}
            {% if e.edge %}<div class="tl-edge"><b>{{ t('Conviction:', '可信度：') }}</b> {{ t(e.edge, e.edge_zh) }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if e.forward %}<div class="tl-fwd">{{ t(e.forward, e.forward_zh) }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if e.anchor %}<a href="{{ e.anchor }}" class="tl-link">{{ t('View on dashboard →', '在仪表盘查看 →') }}</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="sub faint" style="padding:10px 0">{{ t('No alerts in the last', '最近') }} {{ timeline_days }} {{ t('days — markets quiet on every tracked signal.', '天无警报 — 所有跟踪信号均平静。') }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:14px">{{ t('Near-real-time: flash-crash & impulse update intraday (~15–45 min, price-only); on-chain & regime signals update daily. Built', '近实时：闪崩与脉冲信号日内更新（约 15–45 分钟，仅价格）；链上与周期信号每日更新。生成于') }} {{ built }}.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== CALIBRATION TRANSPARENCY ===================== -->
  <div class="section-title">{{ t('How much to trust this · measured records', '可信度如何 · 实测记录') }}</div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>{{ t('Signal verdicts', '信号评定') }} <span class="faint" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600">{{ t('forward outcomes,', '前瞻结果，') }} {{ calib.meta.span }}{{ t(', split-half', '，前后半段分检') }}</span></h3>
    <table class="catbl">
      <tr><td class="a">{{ t('Signal', '信号') }}</td><td>{{ t('Verdict', '评定') }}</td><td class="a">{{ t('What\'s measured', '测量内容') }}</td></tr>
      {% for sig,e in calib.signals.items() %}
      <tr><td class="a">{{ sig }}</td>
        <td><span class="verdict {{ 'v-conf' if 'CONFIRMED' in e.verdict else ('v-dir' if 'DIRECTIONAL' in e.verdict else 'v-ctx') }}">{{ td(e.verdict) }}</span></td>
        <td class="sub">{{ t('forward-return monotonicity by band', '按分档的前瞻收益单调性') }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
      {% if calib.risk_drawdown %}
      <tr><td class="a">{{ t('risk_index (as risk)', 'risk_index（作为风险）') }}</td>
        <td><span class="verdict {{ 'v-conf' if 'CONFIRMED' in calib.risk_drawdown.verdict else 'v-dir' }}">{{ td(calib.risk_drawdown.verdict) }}</span></td>
        <td class="sub">{{ t('forward 7-day drawdown by band (its real job)', '按分档的前瞻 7 天回撤（其真正职责）') }}</td></tr>
      {% endif %}
    </table>
    <div class="sub" style="margin-top:12px">{{ t('House rule: a signal is labelled trustworthy only if its forward record holds in both halves of history. The Risk Index is judged on forward', '内部准则：只有当一个信号的前瞻记录在历史的前后两半段都成立时，才会被标记为可信。风险指数以前瞻') }} <b>{{ t('drawdown', '回撤') }}</b> {{ t('(not return) — at long horizons extreme risk marks capitulation, so it is contrarian there by design. Momentum on free data', '（而非收益）来评判 — 在长周期下，极端风险标志着投降式抛售，因此其在该处的设计本就是逆向的。在免费数据上，动量') }} <b>{{ t('leads', '领先') }}</b> {{ t('Swissblock\'s by ~2 weeks and matches their published', 'Swissblock 约 2 周，并在 65–69% 的交易日与其公布的') }} <em>{{ t('risk regime', '风险周期') }}</em> {{ t('65–69% of days; their proprietary momentum uses entity-adjusted flows we can\'t replicate for free.', '相符；他们的专有动量使用了我们无法免费复现的实体调整资金流。') }}</div>
  </div>

  {% set ep = calib.ensemble_promotion %}
  {% if ep and ep.net_sharpe %}
  <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h3>{{ t('Ensemble capstone · does combining beat the hand-tuned stance?', '集成总验 · 组合能否击败手调立场？') }}</h3>
    <div class="sub">{{ t('We tested a principled, fixed-form ensemble (the gate-passed signals collapsed to 6 orthogonal axes, each oriented by its CALIBRATED expected-return map, de-correlated, equal-weight combined) against the hand-tuned Stance and the single best signal — net of cost, in both halves. The honest result:', '我们用一个有原则的固定形式集成（将通过校准的信号收敛为 6 个正交轴，各按其已校准的预期收益映射定向、去相关、等权组合）对比手调“立场”与单一最佳信号 — 扣除成本、在前后两半段中检验。诚实结论：') }}</div>
    <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)">{{ td(ep.verdict) }}</div>
    <table class="catbl" style="margin-top:10px">
      <tr><td class="a">{{ t('Read','读数') }}</td><td>{{ t('Net Sharpe (full)','净夏普（全样本）') }}</td><td>{{ t('pre-2021','2021 前') }}</td><td>{{ t('post-2021','2021 后') }}</td></tr>
      {% set names = {'heuristic':['Hand-tuned Stance (shipped)','手调立场（已采用）'],'ensemble_eqw':['Orthogonalized ensemble','正交集成'],'best_single':['Best single signal','单一最佳信号']} %}
      {% for key in ['heuristic','ensemble_eqw','best_single'] %}{% set row = ep.net_sharpe[key] %}
      <tr><td class="a">{{ t(names[key][0], names[key][1]) }}{% if key=='best_single' %} <span class="faint">({{ ep.best_single }})</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td><b>{{ row.full }}</b></td><td>{{ row.pre }}</td><td>{{ row.post }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px">{{ t('The ensemble (rank-IC', '该集成（秩 IC') }} {{ ep.ensemble_ic }}{{ t(' vs 90-day return) clearly beats the best single signal — de-redundancy + orthogonalization earn their keep — but does NOT beat the hand-tuned Stance in either half, so the Stance is KEPT and is now validated rather than just hand-set. We do not ship a worse model to look sophisticated (forecast-combination on ~3 cycles: equal-weight and best-single are brutal baselines). The ensemble research lives in the calibration report.', ' 对比 90 天收益）明显优于单一最佳信号 — 去冗余与正交化确有其值 — 但在任一半段均未击败手调“立场”，故保留“立场”，且其现已被验证而非仅靠手调。我们不会为了显得高级而采用更差的模型（约 3 个周期上的预测组合：等权与单一最佳是极难超越的基准）。集成研究详见校准报告。') }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="foot">
    Bitcoin Vector · {{ t('built', '生成于') }} {{ built }} · {{ t('data as of', '数据截至') }} {{ as_of }}.
    {{ t('Independent reverse-engineering of Glassnode/Swissblock\'s Bitcoin Vector on free public data', '基于免费公开数据对 Glassnode/Swissblock 的 Bitcoin Vector 进行的独立逆向工程') }}
    (CoinMetrics, BGeometrics, Coinbase, Deribit, DefiLlama, mempool.space, Fear&amp;Greed).
    {{ t('Not investment advice. Signals are mechanical and backtested; every claim carries its measured record.', '非投资建议。信号为机械化且经回测；每一项主张均附带其实测记录。') }}
    {{ t('Limitations:', '局限性：') }} <a href="https://github.com/chriswong6031-creator/macro/blob/main/LIMITATIONS.md">LIMITATIONS.md</a>.
  </div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var fil=document.querySelectorAll('.tlf'), items=document.querySelectorAll('.tl-item');
  fil.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){
    fil.forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('active')}); b.classList.add('active');
    var f=b.dataset.f;
    items.forEach(function(it){ it.hidden=!(f==='all'||it.dataset.f===f); });
    document.querySelectorAll('.tl-day').forEach(function(d){
      var any=[...d.querySelectorAll('.tl-item')].some(function(i){return !i.hidden});
      d.style.display=any?'':'none';
    });
  });});
})();
</script>
